<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="404182359"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1536017193"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="それは小さな光のような"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="さユり"/><amll:meta key="album" value="それは小さな光のような (期間生産限定盤)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:32.907"><div begin="00:09.278" end="04:13.864"><p begin="00:09.278" end="00:12.562" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">僕だけが見てた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是唯我眼中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku da ke ga mi te ta</span></p><p begin="00:12.630" end="00:15.865" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">君のこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所见的你的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko to</span></p><p begin="00:15.875" end="00:19.524" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">過去も未来も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的过去未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ko mo mi ra i mo</span></p><p begin="00:19.587" end="00:24.993" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">かなしみもよろこびも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的悲伤喜悦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na shi mi mo yo ro ko bi mo</span></p><p begin="00:25.003" end="00:28.591" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">全て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的所有一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te</span></p><p begin="00:29.234" end="00:32.403" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">オトナになるってきっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直深信 长大成人后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to na ni na ru 't te ki 't to</span></p><p begin="00:32.413" end="00:39.595" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">優しくなる事だと信じていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就能善待周遭 善待世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi ku na ru ko to da to shi n ji te i ta</span></p><p begin="00:39.605" end="00:45.188" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">子供の頃の僕のままに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如孩童时的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko do mo no ko ro no bo ku no ma ma ni</span></p><p begin="00:45.536" end="00:49.854" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">君のこと守りたいと思う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一心只想将你守护</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko to ma mo ri ta i to o mo u</span></p><p begin="00:49.864" end="00:52.477" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">暗闇から目覚めても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕从漫漫长夜中醒来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ra ya mi ka ra me za me te mo</span></p><p begin="00:52.536" end="00:57.388" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">僕を待ち受けてる彼方で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那静待我前往的彼方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku wo ma chi u ke te ru ka na ta de</span></p><p begin="00:57.398" end="01:01.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">二人を隠したこの街に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你我藏踪蹑迹的街道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri wo ka ku shi ta ko no ma chi ni</span></p><p begin="01:01.363" end="01:07.631" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">誰も知らない雪が降っていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雪花悄无声息飘落而下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo shi ra na i yu ki ga fu 't te i ta</span></p><p begin="01:07.641" end="01:11.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">君は僕の胸に刻まれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就像镌刻在我的心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wa bo ku no mu ne ni ki za ma re ta</span></p><p begin="01:11.360" end="01:16.695" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">一番深い傷跡のようで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那道最深入骨髓的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi ba n fu ka i ki zu a to no yo u de</span></p><p begin="01:16.705" end="01:24.891" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">君が笑うこの世界の歌<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要重夺这世界的乐章</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga wa ra u ko no se ka i no u ta</span></p><p begin="01:24.901" end="01:30.851" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">取り戻すよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为再见重拾笑颜的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ri mo do su yo</span></p><p begin="01:36.737" end="01:39.945" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">どの部屋の時計も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每间房的时钟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do no he ya no to ke i mo</span></p><p begin="01:39.955" end="01:43.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">少しズレていてさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都些许的偏离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko shi zu re te i te sa</span></p><p begin="01:43.397" end="01:47.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">僕らはいつも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我就像齿轮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra wa i tsu mo</span></p><p begin="01:47.050" end="01:56.192" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">言葉を掛け違う歯車<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是各执一端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba wo ka ke chi ga u ha gu ru ma</span></p><p begin="01:56.724" end="01:59.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">ひとりぼっちで泣いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你独自抹泪的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri bo 'c chi de na i ta</span></p><p begin="01:59.844" end="02:02.159" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">ヒーローごっこ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我扮演着英雄的角色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi i ro o go 'k ko</span></p><p begin="02:02.260" end="02:07.047" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">伸ばす前にくじけた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却在拯救你前就已心灰意冷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no ba su ma e ni ku ji ke ta</span></p><p begin="02:07.057" end="02:12.747" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">両手で君の頬に触れた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伸出双手轻触你脸颊的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ryo u te de ki mi no ho ho ni fu re ta</span></p><p begin="02:13.057" end="02:17.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">君のこと壊したいと思う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中却想要摧毁眼前的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko to ko wa shi ta i to o mo u</span></p><p begin="02:17.415" end="02:20.009" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">世界は夢の狭間で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界在梦的夹缝间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i wa yu me no ha za ma de</span></p><p begin="02:20.054" end="02:24.073" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">黒い祈りを孕んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孕育出黑暗的祈祷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ro i i no ri wo ha ra n de</span></p><p begin="02:24.792" end="02:28.743" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">大事なものだと撫でていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">旧时抚摸心中珍爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i ji na mo no da to na de te i ta</span></p><p begin="02:28.781" end="02:34.281" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">優しい指がねじれてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">温柔指尖倏然扭曲</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi i yu bi ga ne ji re te yu ku</span></p><p begin="02:34.291" end="02:37.389" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">僕はただ僕のために<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这次我要为我自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku wa ta da bo ku no ta me ni</span></p><p begin="02:37.399" end="02:39.951" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">力なきこの手を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不自量力一回</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ka ra na ki ko no te wo</span></p><p begin="02:39.961" end="02:44.156" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">微かな輝きの方へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着烁放微光的彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka su ka na ka ga ya ki no ho u he</span></p><p begin="02:44.166" end="02:46.763" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">もがいてみる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拼死挣扎一番</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo ga i te mi ru</span></p><p begin="02:46.793" end="02:52.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">君の歌う未来へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请指引我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no u ta u mi ra i he</span></p><p begin="02:52.934" end="02:56.369" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">導いてよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前往你所歌唱的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi chi bi i te yo</span></p><p begin="03:15.073" end="03:17.292" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">守りたいと思う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要守护你的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma mo ri ta i to o mo u</span></p><p begin="03:17.351" end="03:21.184" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">まぎれもなくあたたかい場所が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一心相信我们定能抵达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma gi re mo na ku a ta ta ka i ba sho ga</span></p><p begin="03:21.194" end="03:24.213" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">あることを信じてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光普照温暖洋溢之地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru ko to wo shi n ji te ru</span></p><p begin="03:24.223" end="03:29.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">寂しさに喰われた優しさが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被寂寞吞噬殆尽的温柔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa bi shi sa ni ku wa re ta ya sa shi sa ga</span></p><p begin="03:29.170" end="03:35.117" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">白い雪に埋もれて行く夜<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逐渐被白雪掩埋的黑夜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ro i yu ki ni u mo re te i ku yo ru</span></p><p begin="03:35.127" end="03:39.933" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">君は僕の胸に小さな火を灯す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你在我心间点亮小小的灯火</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wa bo ku no mu ne ni chi i sa na hi wo to mo su</span></p><p begin="03:40.019" end="03:44.197" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">古い傷跡のようで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像是一道经年累月的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru i ki zu a to no yo u de</span></p><p begin="03:44.207" end="03:46.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">微笑んでよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对我笑一笑吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ho e n de yo</span></p><p begin="03:46.725" end="03:51.631" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">この世界の暗闇から<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你所吟唱的歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no se ka i no ku ra ya mi ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:51.672" end="03:58.566" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">目覚めてゆく光のような<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿若救赎的微光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me za me te yu ku hi ka ri no yo u na</span></p><p begin="03:58.576" end="04:04.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">君のうた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我从黑暗的世界醒过来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no u ta</span></p><p begin="04:04.200" end="04:07.584" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">僕だけが見てた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是唯我眼中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku da ke ga mi te ta</span></p><p begin="04:07.644" end="04:13.864" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">君のこと......<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所见的你的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko to</span></p></div></body></tt>